existential risk estimates

17
00:01:28,463 --> 00:01:33,864
rely heavily on theoretical arguments,
expert judgment, and reasoning

18
00:01:34,004 --> 00:01:37,986
about future scenarios that have never
occurred. There is

19
00:01:38,105 --> 00:01:44,028
no standardized methodology for
calculating p.dume. Each estimate reflects

20
00:01:44,088 --> 00:01:49,450
